Package: party.jailbreak.omega-app
Name: Omega
Version: 1.2.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Native Omega app. Tabbed UI (Dashboard / Modules / DNS / Settings / Log) to drive the on-device revocation cleanup: toggle each technique (OCSP cache, ban-lists, valid.sqlite3, service restart), install a local DNS block (dnsmasq @ 127.0.0.1) + its profile, and read the worker log. Needs the omega-ondevice worker.
Author: Omega
Maintainer: Omega
Section: Applications
Depends: party.jailbreak.omega-ondevice (>= 1.6.0)
